+## Quick Summary
+
+**In 30 seconds:** A fully automated home-loan approval system. Applicants upload documents, AI agents verify them instantly, and get an approved/conditional/declined decision within minutes. Borderline cases automatically escalate to a human underwriter.
+
+---
+
+## Quick Start
+
+Get a complete installation running in ~10 minutes. (This section assumes you have the full codebase with `backend/`, `frontend/`, and `agent_flow/` directories. If you're in this repository without those directories, see the [Setup & installation](#setup--installation) section for detailed instructions.)
+
+### Minimum prerequisites
+- **Python 3.11+**
+- **Node.js 18+** + npm
+- **AWS account** with:
+  - Bedrock access (Amazon Nova Pro model enabled)
+  - S3 bucket
+  - DynamoDB table
+  - SES verified sender email
+
+### Setup (5 minutes)
+
+```bash
+# 1. Clone and set up Python
+git clone <repo-url> HomeLoanAgent && cd HomeLoanAgent
+python -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate  # Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate
+pip install -r requirements.txt
+
+# 2. Configure AWS
+aws configure  # or set AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID, AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY, AWS_DEFAULT_REGION=us-east-1
+
+# 3. Update the three constants in backend/server.py (see Configuration section):
+#    S3_BUCKET, DDB_TABLE, SES_SENDER
+
+# 4. Set up frontend
+cd frontend && npm install && cp .env.example .env
+```
+
+### Run (2 minutes)
+
+**Terminal 1 — Backend:**
+```bash
+cd backend
+uvicorn server:app --reload --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000
+```
+
+**Terminal 2 — Frontend:**
+```bash
+cd frontend
+npm run dev
+```
+
+**Then:** Open **http://localhost:5173**, register an account (first user is admin), and submit a test application. Check the admin console to manually approve borderline cases.
+
+---
+
+## User Journeys
+
+### An applicant's journey
+1. Opens the app and **registers** (creates login credentials)
+2. Clicks **"Start application"** and uploads three documents:
+   - Identity (Aadhaar/PAN)
+   - Income (payslip, bank statement, or tax return)
+   - Collateral (property deed or valuation report)
+3. The system **auto-classifies** each upload (rejects mismatched types)
+4. Enters the application form (loan amount, tenure, property value, etc.)
+5. Clicks **Submit** — and immediately sees **"Your application is being reviewed"**
+6. Waits **2–5 minutes**; the AI agents finish verification → the dashboard updates with:
+   - ✅ **Approved** — funds ready, EMI disclosed
+   - ⏳ **Under Review** — a human underwriter will decide (email notification sent)
+   - ❌ **Declined** — reason explained, next steps (if any)
+7. Receives a **PDF decision report** by email with all details
+
+### An underwriter's journey (for conditional cases)
+1. Notices in the admin console a metric tile: **"5 applications under review"**
+2. Clicks to see the list, selects a case, and sees:
+   - Applicant details (name, income, existing loans)
+   - All extracted facts (which the AI agent verified)
+   - Why the case was escalated (e.g., "FOIR at 50%, borderline")
+   - **1-hour presigned links** to original documents in S3
+3. Reviews documents, then either:
+   - **Approves** — case closes, applicant emails a congratulatory letter
+   - **Declines** — case closes, applicant is notified with a reason
+4. Returns to the dashboard; the case no longer appears under "Under review"
+
